rgbdns (0.1.1+deb1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Synchronize multiple secondary zones from one primary.
  * Retain a per-zone last-known-good snapshot when a routine AXFR fails.
  * Require every newly configured zone to transfer before initial activation.
